From: Erin Lo <erin.lo@mediatek.com>

Provide a basic driver to control Cortex M4 co-processor

Signed-off-by: Erin Lo <erin.lo@mediatek.com>
Signed-off-by: Nicolas Boichat <drinkcat@chromium.org>
